{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator RNA Properties.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator RNA Properties.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender operator rna properties blender operator rna properties","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator RNA Properties.md","fileName":"Blender Operator RNA Properties.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Operator RNA Properties","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender RNA Data Architecture]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender RNA Data Architecture","Blender StructRNA","Blender PointerRNA","Blender RNA Access API","Blender DNA RNA Mapping","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator RNA Properties.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator RNA Properties.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender operator rna properties blender operator rna properties","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator RNA Properties.md","fileName":"Blender Operator RNA Properties.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Operator RNA Properties","heading":"Blender Operator RNA Properties","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A Blender operator type points to a [[Blender StructRNA]] that describes the values accepted by that operation. When an operator call begins, Blender creates a [[Blender PointerRNA]] for those properties, sanitizes supplied values, and carries the pointer into the operator instance.\n\nThe execution callback reads settings through the [[Blender RNA Access API]] and then passes concrete values to editor and kernel functions. This turns an operator into a bridge between contextual input and the [[Blender DNA RNA Mapping]] that ultimately changes persistent application data."